│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Main improvements:                                                                        │
│                          │ - Microstructure confirmation now blends multiple OBI horizons, book pressure, depth,     │
│                          │ spread, and Kyle lambda into a single quality score.                                      │
│                          │ - Directional entries are gated by trend/momentum confirmation, with separate             │
│                          │ mean-reversion exceptions when price is stretched relative to VWAP/Bollinger/RSI.         │
│                          │ - Funding and session context are used asymmetrically to suppress trades into adverse     │
│                          │ carry or low-quality periods.                                                             │
│                          │ - Position sizing is now tied to edge quality, execution cost, and volatility regime      │
│                          │ instead of being fixed.                                                                   │
│                          │ - Take-profit, stop-loss, and holding period are volatility-adjusted and shortened in     │
│                          │ noisy or expensive regimes.                                                               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This should improve win rate and drawdown control while preserving enough trade frequency │
│                          │ for Sharpe and total return.                                                              │
