│                          │ to the high-performing seed, maintaining a robust 1.4:1 reward-to-risk ratio.             │
│                          │ 2. Implementing "light-touch" microstructure filters (OBI, Spread, VWAP Deviation, and    │
│                          │ Wick Rejection) to eliminate high-drawdown trades without significantly reducing the      │
│                          │ trade frequency needed for a high Sharpe ratio.                                           │
│                          │ 3. Introducing a liquidity-adjusted position sizer that scales based on model confidence  │
│                          │ and Kyle's Lambda (market impact), ensuring larger bets are placed when the environment   │
│                          │ is liquid and certain.                                                                    │
│                          │ 4. Using session-based time exits, extending hold time to 5 bars (75 mins) during         │
