│                          │ preventing stop-outs during noise.                                                        │
│                          │ 3.  **Refined Microstructure Filters**: Uses OBI and VWAP deviation "safety switches" to  │
│                          │ filter signals that conflict with immediate order book pressure or over-extended mean     │
│                          │ reversion.                                                                                │
│                          │ 4.  **Autocorrelation-Based Hold Times**: Adapts the trade duration based on price-action │
│                          │ persistence (Autocorr) and trend strength, optimizing the 4-5 bar sweet spot identified   │
│                          │ in the historical performance metrics.                                                    │
│                          │ 5.  **Multi-Factor Sizing**: Adjusts position size by both model confidence and the       │
│                          │ realized volatility ratio to normalize risk-adjusted exposure.                            │
