│ patch_description        │ This edit adds a richer regime-aware entry filter and volatility-adjusted asymmetric risk │
│                          │ management without changing the overall structure of the signal engine. The main          │
│                          │ improvement is to combine the model forecast with multiple orthogonal confirmations:      │
│                          │ microstructure alignment, trend/momentum strength, mean-reversion exhaustion, volatility  │
│                          │ regime, spread/liquidity cost, and funding carry pressure.                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Compared with the current version, this should reduce low-quality trades during noisy or  │
│                          │ adverse conditions while allowing larger sizing when prediction, order book, and          │
│                          │ price-action signals are aligned. It also introduces asymmetric take-profit and stop-loss │
│                          │ settings that adapt to volatility and directional conviction, which can improve the       │
│                          │ combined score by balancing win rate, drawdown, and payoff asymmetry.                     │
