│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ micro_and_vwap_refinement                                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ Optimizes the trade entry and sizing logic by incorporating deeper microstructure         │
│                          │ (OBI-10), liquidity impact (Kyle Lambda), and trend-aligned filtering (VWAP deviation).   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Key improvements:                                                                         │
│                          │ 1.  **Refined Microstructure Weighting**: Includes OBI-10 to capture deeper book          │
│                          │ imbalances and slightly increases the weight of book pressure.                            │
│                          │ 2.  **Adaptive Thresholding**: Lowered the base return threshold from 0.0018 to 0.0017    │
│                          │ and relaxed it further by 15% when microstructure is strongly aligned with the trade      │
│                          │ direction. This increases trade frequency for the highest-conviction setups.              │
│                          │ 3.  **VWAP Guard**: Introduced a VWAP deviation filter (90 bps) to prevent entries into   │
│                          │ extreme parabolic moves that are prone to mean reversion.                                 │
│                          │ 4.  **Sizing Adjustments**: Increased base position size slightly (0.13 to 0.14) and      │
│                          │ added a volatility-regime penalty to reduce exposure during periods of extreme            │
│                          │ instability.                                                                              │
│                          │ 5.  **Dynamic Time Horizon**: Allowed trending trades to stay open for 5 bars (vs 4) to   │
│                          │ capture more persistence when trend strength is high.                                     │
