│ patch_description        │ This edit refines the trading logic to recover the win rate that degraded in the previous │
│                          │ iteration.                                                                                │
│                          │ 1.  **Threshold Correction**: Slightly increases the base threshold to 0.00170 to filter  │
│                          │ out lower-quality signals (capturing the balance between trade count and win rate).       │
│                          │ 2.  **Microstructure Refinement**: Updates the Microstructure Quality (MQ) weights to a   │
│                          │ more balanced distribution across multiple tau horizons and includes tau10 for better     │
│                          │ stability.                                                                                │
│                          │ 3.  **Liquidity & Exhaustion Filters**: Introduces Kyle's Lambda (market impact) and      │
│                          │ Bollinger %B filters. Kyle's Lambda helps avoid trading in illiquid spikes, while BB %B   │
│                          │ prevents buying at the top of a range (exhaustion).                                       │
│                          │ 4.  **Exit Normalization**: Reverts TP/SL anchors to the proven 40/30 bps levels and      │
│                          │ dampens the elasticity slightly to stabilize performance.                                 │
│                          │ 5.  **Funding & Spread Tightening**: Tighter spread and funding limits are reapplied to   │
│                          │ maintain a higher profit factor.                                                          │
