│ patch_description        │ This update introduces several refinements to improve signal quality and capture more     │
│                          │ profitable momentum trades:                                                               │
│                          │ 1.  **Trend-Adaptive Thresholds**: Lowers the entry threshold during strong trends (using │
│                          │ `trend_strength`) to capture momentum earlier, similar to the high-performing 98.52       │
│                          │ version but with a more aggressive 5% adjustment.                                         │
│                          │ 2.  **Enhanced Microstructure Quality**: Incorporates `obi_tau10` into the                │
│                          │ `micro_quality` metric to provide a more stable view of order book imbalance across       │
│                          │ multiple time horizons.                                                                   │
│                          │ 3.  **Exhaustion & Mean-Reversion Filters**: Adds loose filters using `rsi_14` and        │
│                          │ `vwap_dev` to avoid entering long at extreme overbought levels or entering short at       │
│                          │ extreme oversold levels.                                                                  │
│                          │ 4.  **Dynamic Time Exits**: Extends the `max_bars` limit when volatility is trending up   │
│                          │ or when the price is significantly deviated from VWAP, allowing more time for the         │
│                          │ predicted move or mean reversion to materialize.                                          │
