│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ regime_fusion_filters                                                                     │
│ patch_description        │ This edit upgrades the signal from a pure threshold-and-microstructure approach into a    │
│                          │ lightweight regime-aware selector.                                                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The main improvement is adding a small set of orthogonal filters that are common sources  │
│                          │ of edge in short-horizon crypto:                                                          │
│                          │ - trend confirmation via `trend_strength`, `macd_signal`, `autocorr_5`, and recent        │
│                          │ returns,                                                                                  │
│                          │ - exhaustion/mean-reversion avoidance via `rsi_14`, `bb_pct`, and `vwap_dev`,             │
│                          │ - execution quality via `depth_ratio_5`, `kyle_lambda_est`, and `spread_bps`,             │
│                          │ - carry-risk timing via `funding_rate`, `funding_8h_ma`, and `minutes_to_funding`.        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ It keeps the original threshold structure and sizing logic intact, but makes entries more │
│                          │ selective when the market is noisy or crowded, while allowing asymmetric long/short       │
│                          │ behavior when momentum and order flow align. Stops and take-profit are also made slightly │
│                          │ more adaptive to ATR and microstructure friction, which should help preserve win rate     │
│                          │ while improving profitability per trade.                                                  │
│ num_applied              │ 3                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0139                                                                                   │
